# Files the formatter must skip.
#
# routeTree.gen.ts is emitted by the TanStack router plugin on every build. The
# plugin exposes no print-width option and wraps differently from oxfmt, so the
# generated tree is rewritten on each build and `vp check` could never pass after
# one. The file stays committed (tsc needs it on a fresh clone) and is skipped
# here instead.
